 "title": "Hypertension diagnosis decision chart: one high reading is not hypertension; visit 1 thresholds send the patient to out-of-office measurement (ambulatory preferred, or home) or to repeated office visits, which confirm hypertension or white coat hypertension; every patient then gets baseline tests and is checked for aggravating drugs and habits, obstructive sleep apnea, primary aldosteronism, kidney or renovascular disease and other endocrine causes",
